  "description": "Watch now | StockTok Weekly Wrap Up 12/12",
  "body_html": "<p>There is a “heads-up” in the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/a27b2288-ae6c-4cb6-833a-bfb84d676813\">Quick Notes</a> section of the chat. Keep <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$APLD&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> on your radar. The chart formation looks nearly identical to Rigetti, before it ran over 220%, one of our best positions of the year! I am waiting for a “break” upwards.</p><p> Of our 4 current positions, 3 are in profit and the 4th is at break even at this moment. Amkor is up over 6% and Unity Software up over 4% in just a few days. The market is working in our favor; so picking up new positions or adding to current runners is the gameplan. I intend to pick up another position this afternoon, and will update down below which one I pick up. Peter Brandt, a professional commodity and foreign exchange trader for the last thirty years, discussed how a green Friday, often times leads into a green Monday and Tuesday, something I picked up and occasionally like to put to practice. So of the stocks below, I am seeing what holds, hence why I am waiting until the afternoon. </p><p>If you missed any of these posts or updates this week, be sure to check them out when you have some time:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/is-netflix-bullish-or-bearish?r=4z8lgl\">Is Netflix Bullish or Bearish?</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-market-update-stock-looking?r=4z8lgl\">High Level View of the Stock Market</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/buying-this-stock?r=4z8lgl\">Buying This Silver Related Stock…</a></p></li></ul><p><strong>If you actually liked this video, please do leave a like and re-stack. </strong><em><strong>If you didn’t like it, leave a hate comment down below</strong></em><strong> 😂</strong></p><p>Hope you have a great weekend and THANKS FOR STOPPING BY! 👍</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok?utm_source=user-menu\">StockTok Main Page</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Positions</a> |</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a></p><h3>👇 The Stocks I Am Watching To Pick Up Today 12/12 👇</h3>",
